* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sig binary
# Signed bytes. The rules above would otherwise treat catalog.json as text and
# rewrite its line endings, which invalidates catalog.json.sig. -text leaves the
# committed bytes alone. The signature is binary, so Git never diffs it as lines.
catalog.json -text linguist-language=JSON
catalog.json.sig binary
